<title>USA: Fleetwood Q1 July 28 shr up, includes gain.</title>
<headline>Fleetwood Q1 July 28 shr up, includes gain.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.40		    $0.49</p>
<p> Net			 64,110		   22,798</p>
<p> Sales		    751,245		  704,717</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  45,916		   46,518</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 FY97 ended July 28,1996 includes an after-tax gain of $33.9 million or $0.74 per share from the sale of the company's finance subsidiary. Earnings also include $887,000 or $0.02 per share for one month of operations from the discontinued finance operation.</p>
<p>Full company name is Fleetwood Enterprises Inc</p>
<p>---New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
